{
  "topology_version": "1.1",
  "description": "Synthetic campus network: core router, hostel and department distribution, access layer, APs, DNS/DHCP server. Switch IDs SW_CAMPUS_1..10 are the device IDs the organizer generator emits (B3); the generator supplies no links, so links and capacities are ours. HOSTEL_UPLINK_01 is the shared upstream for every hostel device.",
